      473.27,
      549.66,
      520.34
    ],
    "text": "I, Tissa Kumarasiri Warnasuriya, being the Hon. Governor of the North Western Province, do hereby publish the following Amendment made by me by virtue of the powers conferred by Section 24 of the Provincial Councils Act, No. 15 of 1987, read with Section 2 of the Provincial Councils (Incidental Provisions) Act, No. 12 of 1989, to Regulation 3(1) of the Gazette No. 2238/35-2021, dated Friday, 30th July, 2021.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
