      55.15,
      529.27,
      524.51,
      596.34
    ],
    "text": "T\u0d82\u0d8c\u0d8c\u0d7a W\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d87\u0d7a\u0d8c\u0d8e\u0d8b\u0d82\u0d92\u0d7a, Governor, North Western Province. At Kurunegala,21st November, 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      621.27,
      345.65,
      716.34
    ],
    "text": "3. (1) By virtue of the powers conferred by Sub-section (1) of Section 24of the Provincial Councils Act, No. 15 of 1987, read with Section 2 of theProvincial Councils (Consequential Provisions) Act, No. 12 of 1989, hereinafter referred to as the \u201cAct\u201d, the Provincial Councils of theNorth Western Province are hereby granted a further period of 12 months from 01.12.2025, in addition to the further period provided for in these Regulations, to carry out the functions under Section 24 of the said Provincial Councils Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
